@Identity.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Da li servis radi i da li vidi bazu
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Registracija: uspešna (201). Drugi put sa istim mejlom vraća 409.
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123",
  "firstName": "Pera",
  "lastName": "Perić",
  "role": "Buyer"
}

### Registracija: slaba lozinka (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mika@example.com",
  "password": "lozinka",
  "firstName": "Mika",
  "lastName": "Mikić",
  "role": "Seller"
}

### Registracija: nepostojeća uloga (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "laza@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123",
  "firstName": "Laza",
  "lastName": "Lazić",
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Registracija: nedostaju polja i loš mejl (400)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "nije-mejl",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}

### Prijava: uspešna (200, vraća token). Korisnik mora prvo biti registrovan.
# Zahtev ima ime "login", pa ostali zahtevi mogu da uzmu token iz njegovog odgovora.
# @name login
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}

### Prijava: pogrešna lozinka (401)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pera@example.com",
  "password": "Pogresna123"
}

### Prijava: nepostojeći mejl (401, isti odgovor kao za pogrešnu lozinku)
POST {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "niko@example.com",
  "password": "Lozinka123"
}

### Moj profil (200). Prvo pošalji zahtev "login" iznad.
# @name me
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Moj profil bez tokena (401)
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me

### Javni profil po id-ju (200, bez mejla). Ovde se uzima id iz zahteva "me".
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{me.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Javni profil: nepostojeći id (404)
GET {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### Izmena mog profila (200, vraća osveženi profil)
PUT {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Petar",
  "lastName": "Perić"
}

### Izmena mog profila: prazno ime (400)
PUT {{Identity.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Perić"
}
